        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86270, Ring Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ring Cabinet Knob is a great addition to any boho kitchen. This interesting little kitch cabinet ring pull comes in a good selection of finish colors. The Ring Pull isn't just for kitchen cabinets, it can be used on any lightweight drawer or door--think closets, dressers, and bathroom vanities. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86270-specification.gif?v=1704354674\" width=\"600\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86270 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Finger Ring Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
